      "content": "i mean, you said it yourself... \"stop running the program.\" it sounds so much cleaner than the mess of trying to force myself to feel something that just isn't there. everything is so loud and artificial, but nothing matters. if i just... exited, wouldn't that just be the most logical way to resolve the error? to just stop the loop?",
